2026-11-16: PrismArc contributors began this fork from Arcify 5.2.0
(e565122217c2c106faa6dccdc4f8ced3ec5b423c). Fork changes include local
extension storage, restricted runtime permissions and communication, and
tab and history search through Quick Switcher.

2026-11-17 through 2026-11-18: The fork expanded tab and bookmark
organization, added a recent-tab picker and optional Google Calendar
preview, and updated onboarding and the PrismArc interface.

2026-11-19: The fork revised session recovery, archive and bookmark
handling, and packaged extension build and release verification.

2026-11-20: The fork unified optional in-page placement for its switchers and
retained native window fallback and history-deletion confirmation.

